  "topic_id": "t-mm-11-011",
  "book_id": "book-mm-11",
  "title": "6.5.\tANXIETY",
  "source_sha256": "f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605",
  "block_count": 1,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "order": 0,
      "content": "<div class=\"mm-release-marker\" data-mm-release=\"f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605\" data-mm-topic=\"t-mm-11-011\" hidden></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23439]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'>ANXIETY</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23440]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>13%</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23441]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Anxiety disorders include</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23442]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>1. </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Generalized anxiety disorder</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23443]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>2. </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Obsessive \u2013 compulsive disorder OCD</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23444]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>3. </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Post Traumatic stress disorder P</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>TS</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>D</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23445]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>4. </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Social anxiety disorder</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23446]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Assessment of Anxiety disorders:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23447]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>GAD \u2013 2 score</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23448]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>GAD \u2013 7 score</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23449]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>GAD-2</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23450]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Over the last 2 weeks, how often have you been bothered by the following problems:</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23451]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>1. </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Feeling nervous, anxious, or on edge? NAO</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23452]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>       2.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Not being able to stop or control worrying?</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23453]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>GAD-7</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23454]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Over the last 2 weeks, how often have you been bothered by the following problems:</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23455]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>1.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Feeling nervous, anxious or on edge?</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23456]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>2. </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Not being able to stop or control worrying?</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23457]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Worrying too much about different things?</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23458]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Trouble relaxing?</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23459]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Being so restless that it is hard to sit still?</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23460]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Becoming easily annoyed or irritable?</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23461]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Feeling afraid as if something awful might happen?</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23462]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Scores of:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23463]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>5 MILD</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23464]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>10 </strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>moderate</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23465]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>15 sever</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>e</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23466]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>When </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>GAD is </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>used as a screening tool, further evaluation is recommended </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>with</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> the score </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>of</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> 10 or greater.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23467]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> woman scores 3 or more on the GAD-2 scale, consider:</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23468]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>1.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Using the\u00a0</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>GAD-7 scale</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>\u00a0for further assessment </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>or</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23469]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>2</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Referring the woman to her GP or;</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23470]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>              3.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>If a severe mental health problem is </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>   </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>suspected, to a mental health professional.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23471]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>If a woman scores less than 3 on the GAD-2 scale, but you are still concerned she may have an anxiety disorder, ask the following question:</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23472]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>1.</strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Do you find yourself avoiding places or activities and does this cause you problems?</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23473]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>2.</strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>If she responds positively, consider:</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23474]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>3.</strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>using the GAD-7 scale for</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> further assessment or referral</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23475]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23476]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Generalized Anxiety disorder:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23477]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Persistent nervousness</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23478]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Muscular tension </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23479]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Dizziness</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23480]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Palpitation</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23481]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Fear of becoming ill of baby or family </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>members</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23482]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Fear of getting accident.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23483]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Sweating</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23484]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Light headedness</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23485]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Epigastric discomfort</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23486]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>PSTD:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23487]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Flashback </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23488]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Hyperarousal</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23489]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Psychological distress</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23490]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Treatment:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23491]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Only high intensity CBT</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23492]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>OCD:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23493]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Obsessive ideas/ thoughts/ images.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23494]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Management:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23495]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>As general anxiety</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23496]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Inpatient treatment in MBU</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23497]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>ECT very rarely in resistant OCD or severe cases.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23498]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23499]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Tocophobia:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23500]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Morbid dread fear of pregnancy and child birth</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23501]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Primary:</strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> no previous experience of pregnancy</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23502]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Secondary:</strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> develop after traumatic event in previous pregnancy</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23503]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Women avoid pregnancy</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23504]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Request C/S</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23505]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Request termination</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23506]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Sexual assault can be contributory factor</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23507]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Management:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23508]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Explore fears</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23509]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Facilitated self help</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23510]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>CBT</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23511]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Book @ consultant led care</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23512]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Midwife counselors</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23513]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Develop care plan in collaboration with consultant, midwife and women</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23514]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Minimal vaginal examinations</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23515]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>One \u2013 one support and care</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23516]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23517]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Social Anxiety Disorder:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23518]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Also called social phobia</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23519]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Intense fear of being watched by someone or judged by someone</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23520]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Treatment is high intensity CBT</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23521]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23522]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Treatment of Anxiety Disorders</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23523]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23524]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Mild \u2013 moderate</strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>mode Severe</strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Severe</strong></em></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-pa